{"name":"Zambia","hex":"#ff990e","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Zambia","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A country in Southern Africa. Official name: Republic of Zambia. Formerly called Northern Rhodesia."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Zambia"}],"entries":[{"title":"Zambia","blocks":[{"text":"Zambia, officially the Republic of Zambia, is a landlocked country in Southern Africa. It is bordered to the north by the Democratic Republic of the Congo, Tanzania to the northeast, Malawi to the east, Mozambique to the southeast, Botswana and Zimbabwe to the south, Namibia to the southwest, and Angola to the west. The capital city of Zambia is Lusaka, located in the south-central part of Zambia. The population is concentrated mainly around Lusaka in the south and the Copperbelt Province to the north, the core economic hubs of Zambia."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/06/Flag_of_Zambia.svg/330px-Flag_of_Zambia.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zambia"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/85/NsaluCave.jpg/500px-NsaluCave.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/85/NsaluCave.jpg/500px-NsaluCave.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Graffitied rock art in Nsalu Cave, Kasanka National Park in North-Central Zambia","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ANsaluCave.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d8/Batonga_women.png/500px-Batonga_women.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d8/Batonga_women.png/500px-Batonga_women.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail",